{"product_id":"emerald-fusion-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Butterfly x Maple x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eBold, vibrant, and meticulously handcrafted, the \u003cstrong\u003eEmerald Fusion\u003c\/strong\u003e reimagines the timeless butterfly cue with a contemporary blend of color, craftsmanship, and precision. Crafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this custom cue butt features expertly executed \u003cstrong\u003ebutterfly splice construction\u003c\/strong\u003e accented by vibrant \u003cstrong\u003emulti-colored veneers\u003c\/strong\u003e that create striking depth and visual movement. The luxurious \u003cstrong\u003eemerald resin wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e serves as the centerpiece, offering a seamless, high-gloss finish, exceptional durability, and a comfortable, confident grip.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Emerald Fusion seamlessly blends traditional cue-making techniques with modern materials. Every detail—from the precision butterfly splice work to the flawless resin finish—reflects the artistry, innovation, and uncompromising quality that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a premium collection, this cue is designed to make a lasting impression.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Butterfly Splice Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVeneers:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multi-Colored Veneers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Emerald Resin Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClassic butterfly craftsmanship. Contemporary elegance. Handcrafted to perform and built to be admired.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453518512176,"sku":null,"price":24000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/3d8d7a17-04df-4ce4-a7e9-b06624fd4c70.png?v=1785656920","url":"https:\/\/cuesmastershop.com\/products\/emerald-fusion-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}